<title>GERMANY: Preussag sees notable rise in 96/97 profits.</title>
<headline>Preussag sees notable rise in 96/97 profits.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>German steel and engineering group Preussag AG said at a news conference that earnings were expected to rise notably in the year to September 30, 1997.</p>
<p>Earlier, the company reported group net profit of 274 million marks for its 1995/95 business year, down from 349 the previous year.</p>
<p>--Terence Gallagher, Bonn Newsroom +49 228 26097150</p>
